  "summary": "As a Principal Software Engineer at Nike, I apply my 25+ years of software development experience to build software on various platforms, using multiple programming languages and technologies. I've passed AWS certifications and commonly use Java, Python, NodeJs, React, and Typescript. I'm a co-leader of the Tech Modernization team, which drives digital transformation efficiencies through Platform Engineering.\n\nI’m passionate about solving business problems with software solutions that deliver value, quality, and efficiency. I follow the 80/20 principle and curiously explore many tools to avoid using the wrong one. I value concise written communication that uses pictures to convey complex ideas. I'm an eternal student that enjoys sharing knowledge and learning from others. I love diverse connected systems, people, and software that create a positive impact.",
